sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor A as Interior Designer
  participant UI as «boundary»<br/>CompanyPage
  participant B as «boundary»<br/>CreateCompanyBoundary
  participant C as «control»<br/>CreateCompanyController
  participant DesignerCompany as «entity»<br/>DesignerCompany
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  A->>UI: add my company information
  UI->>B: POST /api/designer/company (JWT)
  B->>C: create(Integer designerId, CompanyRequest request)
  alt company already exists
    C-->>B: ApiException
    B-->>UI: 409 error JSON
    UI-->>A: show error
  else valid
  C->>DesignerCompany: existsForDesigner()
  DesignerCompany->>DB: SQL
  DB-->>DesignerCompany: rows
  DesignerCompany-->>C: result
  C->>DesignerCompany: save()
  DesignerCompany->>DB: SQL
  DB-->>DesignerCompany: rows
  DesignerCompany-->>C: result
  C-->>B: CompanyResponse
  B-->>UI: 201 Created JSON
  UI-->>A: show result
  end